            <h3 class="title border-red">
                Landfill Operators Certification Training (LOCT)
            </h3>
        </div>
    </a>
    <p>TDEC&#39;s Landfill Operator Certification Program for municipal/Class 1 landfill operators.<br />
</p>

    

</div>


</div>
