            <h3 class="title border-red">
                Waste Tire Hauler Program
            </h3>
        </div>
    </a>
    <p>The Waste Tire Hauler (WTH) Program requires anyone that commercially hauls waste tires to register with TDEC and comply with tracking and reporting requirements.</p>

    

</div>


</div>
                    </div>
                
